22 0 obj
<<
/Title (Conclusion  The React Kanban Board was successfully redesigned to support advanced state tracking through a localized history stack. Undo and Redo operations were implemented without external libraries by maintaining immutable snapshots of application state. The project demonstrates practical understanding of React state management, reference handling, stack-based navigation, and modern front-end architectural principles.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 263 0 R
>>
